 "name_en": "Product Structure Template Management (35Q)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Product Structure Template Management (35Q)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiob2a57a1219b64842b2e3406a973a585e\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob2a57a1219b64842b2e3406a973a585e__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item supports the setup of templates for products or product families with many variants and components. They provide a highly flexible product structure that can manage configurable products or product families as well as non-configurable products as assemblies in one product structure. The product structure template can be built up manually or derived from functional structures. You can structure a product as a set of hierarchically and multi-disciplined (like mechanical and software) ordered objects in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition</span>.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob2a57a1219b64842b2e3406a973a585e__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Manual creation of Product Structure:</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create high level product structure template manually (Product Family/Product View/Product Structure)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Save product structure template</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\">Automated creation of Product Structure:</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create high level product structure template using Block Definition Diagram (BDD)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Save product structure template</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob2a57a1219b64842b2e3406a973a585e__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Structure a product as a set of hierarchically ordered objects and use it as template</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Optimize the definition and maintenance of product structures</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create automatically product hierarchies from Block Definition Diagrams (BDD)</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>产品结构模板管理 (35Q)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiob2a57a1219b64842b2e3406a973a585e\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob2a57a1219b64842b2e3406a973a585e__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目支持为具有许多变式和组件的产品或产品系列设置模板。它们提供高度灵活的产品结构，可以在一个产品结构中管理可配置产品或产品系列以及作为装配的非可配置产品。产品结构模板可以手动构建或从功能结构派生。您可以在 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition</span> 中将产品结构化为一组按层次结构划分的多学科（如机械和软件）订购对象。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob2a57a1219b64842b2e3406a973a585e__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">手动创建产品结构：</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">手动创建高级产品结构模板（产品系列/产品视图/产品结构）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">保存产品结构模板</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\">自动创建产品结构：</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">使用块定义图 (BDD) 创建高级产品结构模板</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">保存产品结构模板</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob2a57a1219b64842b2e3406a973a585e__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">将产品结构化为一组按层次结构排序的对象，并将其用作模板</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">优化产品结构的定义和维护</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">从块定义图 (BDD) 自动创建产品层次结构</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
